  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>Advisors are proficient with simple and martial weapons, light armor, medium armor, and shields (except tower shields). If this is the character’s first level in any class, they may exchange their proficiencies with martial weapons, medium armor, and shields (except bucklers) to select a martial tradition of their choice.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/advisor#toc1\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
